==Battleground==
*1 [[Galactic Overseer Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 36.67~43.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,300f</sup>.
*6 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 36.67~43.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,300f</sup>.
*4 [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 56.67~60 seconds<sup>1,700f~1,800f</sup>.
*7 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Barrier Breaker is required here as well as a backliner to deal with Sleipnir. An uber with both qualities can easily carry the stage.

